msgstr "Maintenance branches and lifecycle."

msgid "维护分支状态包括："
msgstr "Maintaining branch status includes:"

msgid "**活跃（Active）**：持续接受缺陷修复、功能改进和安全补丁；将继续演进功能或发布新版本"
msgstr "**Active**: Continuously receives bug fixes, feature improvements, and security patches; will continue to evolve features or release new versions."

msgid "**维护（Maintenance）**：仅接受关键缺陷修复和安全补丁；不再发布功能改进"
msgstr "**Maintenance**: Only critical bug fixes and security patches are accepted; no feature improvements will be released."

msgid "**停止维护（End of Life）**：不再接受任何修复；分支维护已停止"
msgstr "**End of Life**: No further fixes will be accepted; branch maintenance has ceased."

