"- Enhanced the performance of the search functionality.\n"
"- Improved the user interface for better accessibility.\n"
"- Updated the documentation for clearer instructions.\n"
"\n"
"### Bug Fixes\n"
"- Fixed an issue where the application would crash when loading large files.\n"
"- Resolved a problem with the login flow on certain browsers.\n"
"- Corrected the display of dates in the activity log.\n"
"\n"
"### Known Issues\n"
"- Some users may experience a delay when syncing data across devices.\n"
"- The mobile version may not display all charts correctly on smaller screens.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
